OL,3,GNEWSA'Much-needed' affordable homes due
OL,4,Aby Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlmost two years later than expected,
OL,7,Fan affordable housing project will
OL,8,Fwelcome residents in time for
OL,9,FChristmas, according to developers.
OL,11,FHomes in Somerset has been working with
OL,12,Fcontractor Classic Builders to deliver
OL,13,F33 new one and two-bedroom flats on the
OL,14,FPenlea House site in Bridgwater.
OL,16,FThe first residents were due to move in
OL,17,FJanuary 2025 but the project has faced
OL,18,Fa number of delays, including a
OL,19,Fbreak-in in February.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
