OL,3,GNEWSA'Much-needed' affordable homes due
OL,4,Aby Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Homes in Somerset
OL,7,Fsaid: "We appreciate the patience shown
OL,8,Fby applicants while these final works
OL,9,Fare completed and look forward to
OL,10,FPenlea House providing much-needed
OL,11,Faffordable homes in Bridgwater."
